{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/shcjjt","slideIndex":2,"text":"The existing welcome screen includes an initial curtain reveal. The updated Enter action uses a second curtain opening to reveal the already-mounted homepage underneath. It completes after 1,250 milliseconds. Reduced-motion visitors bypass the timed transition. Session storage remembers entry for the browser session. Direct section anchors bypass the welcome, and #welcome explicitly replays it. The footer also offers replay. This is website behavior, not an embedded PowerPoint animation.\n\nSources: src/components/WelcomeScreen.tsx; src/App.tsx; src/index.css"}
