{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/n7iyz1","slideIndex":9,"text":"Demonstrate the local website. Use #welcome or the footer replay to show the entrance. Show a project search and open a property dialog. Production compilation passed after the visual redesign, while full browser verification remains pending. The developer should complete a live enquiry test without assuming that a configured endpoint proves delivery. Obtain client confirmation for published property images and factual claims before publication.\n\nSources: src/components/WelcomeScreen.tsx; src/components/Projects.tsx; src/components/Footer.tsx; src/components/contact/ContactForm.jsx"}